### Task Model

| Task ID | Task Title | Text | Relation | Location | Number of Robots | Justification |
|---------|------------|------|----------|----------|-------------------|---------------|
| AT1 | Navigate to Storage | Move the robot from its current position to the storage location that holds the requested resource. | **AND** (under G4) | **Storage** | **[1, n]** | Multiple robots may navigate concurrently; the range allows one or more robots. |
| AT2 | Send Request Message | Transmit a precise request for the needed resources to the storage system. | **AND** (under G5) | **Storage** | **1** | Only the robot that is at the storage can send the message. |
| AT3 | Wait for Retrieval Confirmation | Remain idle until the storage confirms that the resources have been retrieved. | **AND** (under G6) | **Storage** | **1** | Single robot must wait; no parallelism needed. |
| AT4 | Navigate to Destination | Move the robot carrying the resources from its current position to the specified delivery location. | **AND** (under G7) | **Destination** | **[1, n]** | Several robots may perform runs in parallel if multiple resources are present. |
| AT5 | Check Battery Level | Query the robot’s battery level at the current location. | **AND** (under G9 & G8) | **Robot Current Location** | **1** | Only the robot itself can read its battery status. |
| AT6 | Return to Recharging Station | Move the robot back to the nearest recharging station when battery < 10 %. | **AND** (under G10) | **RechargingStation** | **1** | Only one robot can perform this action at a time. |
| AT7 | Assign Mission to Another Robot (Collection) | Notify another available robot to take over the remaining collection task. | **AND** (under G11) | **Robot Current Location** | **1** | Assignment is performed by the robot that has just returned. |
| AT8 | Return Resource to Checkpoint | Move the resource back to a predefined checkpoint when battery < 30 %. | **AND** (under G12) | **Checkpoint** | **1** | Only one robot can perform this action. |
| AT9 | Assign Remaining Task (Delivery) | Inform another robot of the remaining runs needed to finish the delivery from the checkpoint. | **AND** (under G13) | **Robot Current Location** | **1** | Assignment is performed by the robot that returned. |
| AT10 | Trigger Alert & Report | Send an alert and a detailed report to the sector manager if the resource cannot be returned to the checkpoint. | **AND** (under G14) | **SectorManager** | **1** | Only one robot can trigger the alert. |

