### Logical Relationships (with Justifications)

| Parent Goal | Child Goals / Tasks | Relation | Justification |
|-------------|---------------------|----------|---------------|
| G1 | G2, G3 | **AND** | Both collection and delivery must be completed for the mission to succeed. |
| G1 | AT1, AT4 | **AND** | Navigation tasks are required for both phases. |
| G2 | G4, G5, G9 | **AND** | Must go to storage, request resource, and monitor battery before proceeding. |
| G4 | AT1 | **AND** | Robot must navigate to storage. |
| G5 | AT2 | **AND** | Sending the request is the only action in this goal. |
| G6 | AT3 | **AND** | Waiting for confirmation is the only action. |
| G7 | AT4 | **AND** | Navigation to destination is the only action. |
| G8 | AT5, AT9 | **AND** | Battery check and assignment of remaining task are required in delivery. |
| G9 | AT5, AT6, AT7 | **AND** | Battery check, return to recharge, and re‑assignment are needed in collection. |
| G10 | AT6 | **AND** | Returning to the recharging station is the only action. |
| G11 | AT7 | **AND** | Assignment of mission to another robot. |
| G12 | AT8 | **AND** | Returning resource to checkpoint. |
| G13 | AT9 | **AND** | Assigning remaining task to another robot. |
| G14 | AT10 | **AND** | Triggering alert and report. |

